# steps/table-receiver.md §10: A's callable field names get, a method of the part
# unit_s7_part_root_field_part.lm2 (harness Parts), whose occurrence is the part's root's child: the builder
# checks the stored occurrence against its lexical parent -- that root, not the unit, else the program would be
# refused at its start.  A\get() reads the part's k: 5.  Entry 7.
A:
    fn: get
    size_t: tag 1U
end: A
size_t: a1 0U
a1: A\get()
if: a1 != 5U
    sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 81; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
    return
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
